[00:00.00]It's raining, sweetie.|下雨啦，宝贝。
[00:07.04]So boring.|好无聊啊。
[00:08.84]Wait a minute.|等一下。
[00:10.56]Put on your raincoat, honey.|把雨衣穿上，亲爱的。
[00:15.18]Can I go play?|我可以出去玩吗？
[00:17.36]Yes, you can.|可以呀。
[00:20.82]I run fast.|我跑得快。
[00:23.58]I jump high.|我跳得高。
[00:25.78]Be careful.|小心点。
[00:30.00]The chick, cat, bunny, and snail come to play.|小鸡、小猫、小兔和小蜗牛都来玩啦。
[00:35.04]Hello, friends. Let's spin. Let's dance.|你们好呀，朋友们。我们转圈圈，我们跳舞。
[00:46.38]Grandma, you play too.|奶奶，你也来玩。
[00:51.92]Rainy days are fun.|下雨天真好玩。
[00:54.92]Look, a rainbow.|快看，彩虹！
[00:56.72]What a lovely rainy day!|多么美好的下雨天啊！
